{"about_the_game":"In magical valley the fruits is ripe. Citizens of the valley decided to find the most capable of them to harvest the fruits. And they make the contest - who will gather fruits in 6 seconds, will be the honored fruit farmer! Jump over the obstacles, don't fall on spikes, and most important - don't stop, or the flame will burn you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete as many levels as you can and harvest tons of fruits to unlock new skins and gain additional lives what helps you finish the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Unlimited arcade game focusing on setting the record.<br />\r\n- 50 unique levels (which change randomly)<br />\r\n- Simple control.<br />\r\n- Dynamic old-school gameplay.<br />\r\n- Beautiful pixel graphics and cool music.<br />\r\n- 6 seconds timer on all levels.<br />\r\n- Harvest fruits to unblock new skins and additional lives.<br />\r\n- Lots of achievements.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"28bf04ebcc1d750593d6c80f6621e474563a02a3.jpg","localized_name":"New Hero","name":"New Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165860/28bf04ebcc1d750593d6c80f6621e474563a02a3.jpg"},{"icon":"a21afb9cbc5eb7fee0e4eca296a39889b82ddad8.jpg","localized_name":"New Hero","name":"New Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165860/a21afb9cbc5eb7fee0e4eca296a39889b82ddad8.jpg"},{"icon":"362b23d670cbcd171bb8a35162c491e77e0d1978.jpg","localized_name":"New Hero","name":"New Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165860/362b23d670cbcd171bb8a35162c491e77e0d1978.jpg"},{"icon":"a3fde418e8a5c842851ca7fb83527707e3e8f0b6.jpg","localized_name":"1","name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1165860/a3fde418e8a5c842851ca7fb83527707e3e8f0b6.jpg"},{"icon":"f217a62534a50085eb4d6d094e8fcdcd57c8ce28.jpg","localized_name":"2","name":"2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s